  "description": "# **The Faults of Exile**\n\n##### Accepting applications\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players.\n\n🔸Farming alts welcome - feed challenges and stockpile so you can focus on leveling your main.\n\n🔸Raid Times (UTC): CL25 @ 5:05am, CL60 @ 6:05am + 7:05am.  Raids will go up in level as our members do.\n\n🔸Right now we are focused on leveling and building the Guild Hall.  Planned additions: Teleport Beacon &amp; Energizing Pool.\n\n### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n### 📜 **𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘** 📜\n\n🔸Top 50 Guilds of season 10 and holding strong in 35th.\n\n🔸CL25 Raids happening daily.\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
